# codex
.codex/

# Go build artifacts: `go build .` / `go run .` produces a binary named after
# the package directory. Each Go adapter's binary lives at `<adapter>/<adapter>`.
# Adapters whose generated protobuf package lives at `<adapter>/<adapter>/v1/`
# are not listed: that path is a directory, so no binary can land there, and
# a line for it would ignore the generated bindings.
